# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:20
translate italian suzy8_eeeec132:

    # "Before bed, I go to the bathroom to wash up and brush my teeth."
    "Prima di andare a letto, vado in bagno a lavarmi e a lavarmi i denti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:21
translate italian suzy8_58353284:

    # "As I'm standing in front of the mirror, I hear a whimpering noise coming from Suzy's room. It sounds like she's crying."
    "Mentre sono in piedi davanti allo specchio, sento un piagnucolio provenire dalla stanza di Suzy. Sembra che stia piangendo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:22
translate italian suzy8_c02d22a8:

    # "Worried about her, I put my toothbrush down and crack open the door slightly to peek into her room."
    "Preoccupato per lei, poso lo spazzolino da denti e socchiudo leggermente la porta per sbirciare nella sua stanza."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:26
translate italian suzy8_4c53ab88:

    # "She lies in her bed, her face buried in her pillow, her body trembling as she cries."
    "È sdraiata nel suo letto, con il viso affondato nel cuscino, il corpo tremante mentre piange."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:27
translate italian suzy8_144a37ee:

    # "What could have gotten her so upset?"
    "Cosa potrà averla sconvolta così tanto?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:30
translate italian suzy8_17528ddd:

    # "I walk into her room and over to her bed, then gently put my hand on her shoulder."
    "Entro nella sua stanza e mi avvicino al suo letto, poi le poso delicatamente una mano sulla spalla."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:31
translate italian suzy8_943a2ff7:

    # pc "Are you okay, [sis]?"
    pc "Stai bene, [sis]?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:34
translate italian suzy8_8da8e030:

    # "Suzy startles and rolls over facing me, her face scrunched and wet from crying, her visage of sadness morphing into one of fury."
    "Suzy sussulta e si gira verso di me, il viso corrugato e bagnato dal pianto, l’espressione di tristezza che si trasforma in rabbia."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:36
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:37
translate italian suzy8_9f19b323:

    # ss "What are you doing in here?"
    ss "Che ci fai qui?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:39
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:40
translate italian suzy8_ef42fa9f:

    # ss "Leave me alone! Get out of my room!"
    ss "Lasciami in pace! Esci dalla mia stanza!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:41
translate italian suzy8_c77c201a:

    # pc "I just heard you crying and..."
    pc "Ti ho appena sentita piangere e..."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:43
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_3.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_3.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:44
translate italian suzy8_cdd05524:

    # ss "GET OUT!"
    ss "VATTENE!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:47
translate italian suzy8_ab5c1d88:

    # "I don't try to talk to her anymore, instead just backing up out of her room and closing the door behind me."
    "Non cerco più di parlarle, mi limito invece a uscire dalla sua stanza e a chiudere la porta dietro di me."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:48
translate italian suzy8_13d9beec:

    # "Wow. I'm just trying to help here, but I guess she doesn't want to talk about it at the moment."
    "Wow. Sto solo cercando di darle una mano, ma immagino che al momento non voglia parlarne."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:49
translate italian suzy8_660f4989:

    # "I lie down in bed and try to get to sleep. I'm having a hard time with it, as I'm both annoyed at and worried about her."
    "Mi sdraio sul letto e cerco di addormentarmi. Faccio fatica, perché sono allo stesso tempo infastidito e preoccupato per lei."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:50
translate italian suzy8_6e6cee1b:

    # "Then I hear the bathroom door open."
    "Poi sento aprirsi la porta del bagno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:53
translate italian suzy8_96b85f4c:

    # ss "[bro]?"
    ss "[bro]?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:54
translate italian suzy8_b8cf090c:

    # "I look over at her. She's standing, looking at me unsure, tears in her eyes."
    "La guardo. È in piedi, mi guarda esitante, con le lacrime agli occhi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:55
translate italian suzy8_d72509a6:

    # pc "Yeah?"
    pc "Sì?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:57
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_4.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_4.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:58
translate italian suzy8_49cdd518:

    # ss "I'm sorry."
    ss "Mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:60
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_5.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_5.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:61
translate italian suzy8_5c597394:

    # ss "I shouldn't have yelled at you."
    ss "Non avrei dovuto urlarti contro."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:63
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_6.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_6.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:64
translate italian suzy8_b9711d8f:

    # ss "I've had a bad night, but I know you were just trying to be nice."
    ss "Ho passato una brutta serata, ma so che stavi solo cercando di essere gentile."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:65
translate italian suzy8_90fab666:

    # pc "It's okay, [sis]. What's wrong?"
    pc "Va tutto bene, [sis]. Cosa c’è che non va?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:67
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_6:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_7.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_7.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:68
translate italian suzy8_4305e5a4:

    # ss "Can I lie next to you?"
    ss "Posso sdraiarmi accanto a te?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:69
translate italian suzy8_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:70
translate italian suzy8_c4dd6e9c:

    # "I slide over on the bed a little, giving her a space to lie down."
    "Mi sposto un po’ sul letto, lasciandole spazio per sdraiarsi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:73
translate italian suzy8_51a02d64:

    # "She slips into the bed with me, not just lying next to me, but cuddling up against me. I'm a little surprised at the touch of her body pressed against me."
    "Si infila nel letto con me, non solo sdraiandosi accanto a me, ma rannicchiandosi contro di me. Sono un po’ sorpresa dal contatto del suo corpo premuto contro il mio."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:74
translate italian suzy8_7a7490da:

    # "She's warm and soft and looks at me with red teary eyes."
    "È calda e morbida e mi guarda con gli occhi rossi e pieni di lacrime."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:75
translate italian suzy8_804e854c:

    # ss "Tim and I broke up."
    ss "Io e Tim ci siamo lasciati."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:76
translate italian suzy8_51e926b3:

    # pc "Tim? This is the guy from Whiterock that you've been talking to every night?"
    pc "Tim? È il ragazzo di Whiterock con cui parlavi tutte le sere?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:77
translate italian suzy8_b6bbe555:

    # ss "Yeah. We'd been dating since high school."
    ss "Sì. Stavamo insieme fin dai tempi del liceo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:78
translate italian suzy8_7bf1d93a:

    # ss "But trying to stay together long-distance was stupid. I knew he would do this!"
    ss "Ma cercare di stare insieme a distanza era una stupidaggine. Sapevo che l’avrebbe fatto!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:79
translate italian suzy8_daef8fe7:

    # pc "Do what?"
    pc "Fatto cosa?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:81
translate italian suzy8_f1148738:

    # ss "Cheat on me!"
    ss "Mi avrebbe tradita!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:82
translate italian suzy8_233ab277:

    # pc "He cheated on you?"
    pc "Ti ha tradita?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:83
translate italian suzy8_3c1bf98f:

    # ss "Yeah, some skank posted a picture of him with her on Instagram and tagged him in it."
    ss "Sì, una sgualdrina ha pubblicato una foto di lui con lei su Instagram e l’ha taggato."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:84
translate italian suzy8_9196b394:

    # ss "I called Tammy's house to talk to her about it, but she wasn't home. I didn't know what I should do."
    ss "Ho chiamato a casa di Tammy per parlarne con lei, ma non era in casa. Non sapevo cosa fare."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:85
translate italian suzy8_3754064d:

    # ss "So I called Tim and questioned him about it and he denied everything, but when I told him that I'd seen the picture he broke down and told me that he had sex with her."
    ss "Così ho chiamato Tim e gli ho chiesto spiegazioni, ma lui ha negato tutto; però, quando gli ho detto che avevo visto la foto, è crollato e mi ha confessato di aver fatto sesso con lei."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:86
translate italian suzy8_e7180c58:

    # ss "So I told him to go to hell and hung up on him."
    ss "Allora gli ho detto di andare al diavolo e gli ho riattaccato il telefono in faccia."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:88
translate italian suzy8_c8c75712:

    # ss "But now, instead of feeling better, I just feel so much worse."
    ss "Ma ora, invece di sentirmi meglio, mi sento solo molto peggio."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:89
translate italian suzy8_2fe34243:

    # ss "Our relationship hadn't really worked since he moved away, but now that it's over..."
    ss "La nostra relazione non funzionava più da quando si era trasferito, ma ora che è finita..."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:90
translate italian suzy8_84ce0886:

    # ss "I don't know, [bro]. It just hurts really bad."
    ss "Non lo so, [bro]. Fa proprio malissimo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:91
translate italian suzy8_559b9ecc:

    # ss "I've never broken up with anybody before. I didn't expect it to hurt this much."
    ss "Non avevo mai rotto con nessuno prima d’ora. Non mi aspettavo che facesse così male."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:93
translate italian suzy8_a553b71e:

    # "She tucks her head up against my side and trembles as more tears come."
    "Appoggia la testa contro il mio fianco e trema mentre le scendono altre lacrime."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:94
translate italian suzy8_b014b603:

    # pc "I'm sorry, [sis]."
    pc "Mi dispiace, [sis]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:95
translate italian suzy8_e08ad0ef:

    # pc "I know it feels bad right now, but it's probably for the best."
    pc "So che adesso ti senti male, ma probabilmente è la cosa migliore."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:96
translate italian suzy8_e73cd5d7:

    # pc "Most people don't end up with their high school sweethearts. You'll find somebody that's better for you."
    pc "La maggior parte delle persone non finisce con il proprio amore del liceo. Troverai qualcuno più adatto a te."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:97
translate italian suzy8_5eb5f8a8:

    # pc "Then you'll wonder how you ever thought that Tom, or whatever his name is, was the one."
    pc "Allora ti chiederai come hai potuto pensare che Tom, o qualunque sia il suo nome, fosse quello giusto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:98
translate italian suzy8_7bf6f4af:

    # "She trembles against me, shaking as she weeps."
    "Lei trema contro di me, scossa dai singhiozzi mentre piange."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:99
translate italian suzy8_f047fac6:

    # "I decide it's better if I don't say anything else and just let her cry it out, holding her close."
    "Decido che è meglio non dire altro e lasciarla piangere a più non posso, tenendola stretta."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:100
translate italian suzy8_b99cb9a8:

    # "After a few minutes of silence, except for her occasional whimpers, she pulls back and looks up at me."
    "Dopo qualche minuto di silenzio, interrotto solo dai suoi singhiozzi occasionali, si stacca da me e mi guarda."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:103
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_7:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_8.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_8.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:104
translate italian suzy8_e8f9747e:

    # ss "Thank you for being here for me."
    ss "Grazie per esserci sempre per me."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:105
translate italian suzy8_3bd2626a:

    # pc "Suzy, I'm always going to be there for you."
    pc "Suzy, ci sarò sempre per te."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:107
translate italian suzy8_3c9076c4:

    # "Something about me saying that seems to completely break her. Her face crumples once again and tears stream out."
    "Qualcosa in quelle mie parole sembra spezzarla completamente. Il suo viso si deforma di nuovo e le lacrime le rigano il viso."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:109
translate italian suzy8_1bb37682:

    # "She tucks her head in again and holds me even tighter."
    "Riappoggia la testa contro di me e mi stringe ancora più forte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:111
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_8:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_8_9.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_8_9.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:112
translate italian suzy8_1696615b:

    # ss "I love you so much."
    ss "Ti voglio tanto bene."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:113
translate italian suzy8_70777701:

    # pc "I love you too, Suzy."
    pc "Anch’io ti voglio bene, Suzy."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:114
translate italian suzy8_f2c77bc3:

    # "She starts crying again and it's like she'll never stop. I just hold her, comforting her. Words won't help anymore."
    "Ricomincia a piangere e sembra che non smetterà mai. Mi limito a stringerla, a confortarla. Le parole ormai non servono più."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:117
translate italian suzy8_e9cb8773:

    # "Then eventually, her tremblings stop, her breathing slows down, her muscles relax, and she falls asleep on my tear-soaked shoulder."
    "Poi, alla fine, i suoi tremori cessano, il respiro rallenta, i muscoli si rilassano e lei si addormenta sulla mia spalla bagnata di lacrime."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:118
translate italian suzy8_8b966f13:

    # "I can't just make her leave now. I guess this is where she's going to be sleeping tonight."
    "Non posso mandarla via proprio ora. Immagino che stanotte dormirà qui."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:120
translate italian suzy8_c8e2b53e:

    # "I lean in slightly, trying not to wake her as I kiss her forehead."
    "Mi chino leggermente, cercando di non svegliarla mentre le bacio la fronte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:121
translate italian suzy8_19c63ea8:

    # pc "Good night, [sis]."
    pc "Buonanotte, [sis]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:124
translate italian suzy8_082a9804:

    # "I close my eyes and fall asleep shortly after."
    "Chiudo gli occhi e mi addormento poco dopo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:127
translate italian suzy8_df28f076:

    # "I sleep through the night and wake in the morning to see that Suzy is already gone."
    "Dormo tutta la notte e al risveglio, al mattino, vedo che Suzy se n’è già andata."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:128
translate italian suzy8_2c293479:

    # "Hungry, I walk down the stairs towards the kitchen. Lisa must be in there cooking, because the lovely aroma of bacon and coffee fills the house."
    "Affamato, scendo le scale verso la cucina. Lisa deve essere lì a cucinare, perché il delizioso profumo di pancetta e caffè riempie la casa."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:131
translate italian suzy8_b3009ba0:

    # "To my surprise, Suzy stands in the kitchen over the stove, finishing up some scrambled eggs."
    "Con mia grande sorpresa, Suzy è in cucina davanti ai fornelli, intenta a finire di preparare delle uova strapazzate."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:132
translate italian suzy8_fe0bdf4c:

    # pc "Good morning."
    pc "Buongiorno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:133
translate italian suzy8_9f60b44f:

    # ss "Oh hey, [bro]. Good morning. I'm just finishing up breakfast, one sec."
    ss "Oh ehi, [bro]. Buongiorno. Sto finendo la colazione, un attimo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:134
translate italian suzy8_6fd0f2a2:

    # pc "You're making breakfast? Should I be concerned?"
    pc "Stai preparando la colazione? Dovrei preoccuparmi?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:135
translate italian suzy8_74ef00b6:

    # ss "No, dummy. I just wanted to thank you for being there for me last night."
    ss "No, sciocchino. Volevo solo ringraziarti per esserci stato per me ieri sera."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:136
translate italian suzy8_68230377:

    # "She moves the skillet off the burner, then turns towards me."
    "Toglie la padella dal fornello, poi si gira verso di me."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:139
translate italian suzy8_75c6023a:

    # "She approaches me and wraps her arms around my neck, pressing her body softly against mine as she hugs me."
    "Si avvicina e mi avvolge il collo con le braccia, premendo delicatamente il suo corpo contro il mio mentre mi abbraccia."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:140
translate italian suzy8_5a3c462c:

    # ss "Thank you so much for last night, [bro]."
    ss "Grazie mille per ieri sera, [bro]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:141
translate italian suzy8_c346adf7:

    # ss "I needed somebody and you were there for me, being exactly what I needed you to be."
    ss "Avevo bisogno di qualcuno e tu c’eri per me, proprio come avevo bisogno che tu fossi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:142
translate italian suzy8_a33a0068:

    # ss "You're the best [brother] I could have ever wanted and I'm so glad that you're here for me."
    ss "Sei il migliore [brother] che avrei mai potuto desiderare e sono così felice che tu sia qui per me."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:143
translate italian suzy8_f6bdc399:

    # pc "You're welcome, Suzy."
    pc "Non c’è di che, Suzy."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:146
translate italian suzy8_7fc29466:

    # ss "So, I made you breakfast. Bacon, eggs, and toast. Plus there's coffee in the machine."
    ss "Allora, ti ho preparato la colazione. Pancetta, uova e toast. E c’è anche il caffè nella macchina."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:147
translate italian suzy8_436cf0ff:

    # pc "Thanks, [sis]. That sounds great."
    pc "Grazie, [sis]. Sembra fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:148
translate italian suzy8_c1cdd033:

    # ss "I hope you enjoy. I have to run though."
    ss "Spero che ti piaccia. Devo scappare, però."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:149
translate italian suzy8_e16ffc7e:

    # ss "Going to meet Tammy at Java Lava to talk about everything that happened last night."
    ss "Vado a trovare Tammy al Java Lava per parlare di tutto quello che è successo ieri sera."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:150
translate italian suzy8_34f75a54:

    # pc "Oh, okay."
    pc "Oh, ok."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:152
translate italian suzy8_d41d8cd9_9:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_thanks1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_thanks1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:153
translate italian suzy8_da613814:

    # ss "Thanks again, [bro]. Love you."
    ss "Grazie ancora, [bro]. Ti voglio bene."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:155
translate italian suzy8_a4a53c8e:

    # "Then, before I can say anything else, she leans in and kisses me."
    "Poi, prima che io possa dire altro, si avvicina e mi bacia."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:156
translate italian suzy8_22f9d124:

    # "Her lips only linger on mine for a moment, then she pulls away."
    "Le sue labbra si posano sulle mie solo per un attimo, poi si allontana."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy8.rpy:158
translate italian suzy8_7079c2be:

    # "I don't think that Suzy has ever been this sweet to me before. It's pretty nice."
    "Non credo che Suzy sia mai stata così dolce con me prima d’ora. È davvero bello."

